{'symbol': 'ALGN', 'date': '2020-11-18 16:45:00', 'title': 'ALIGN TECHNOLOGY TO HOST VIRTUAL INVESTOR DAY ON NOVEMBER 23, 2020', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF., NOV. 18, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ALIGN TECHNOLOGY, INC. (NASDAQ: ALGN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL HOST A VIRTUAL INVESTOR DAY ON MONDAY, NOVEMBER 23, 2020, BEGINNING AT 8:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME.'}{'symbol': 'ALGN', 'date': '2020-11-18 16:00:00', 'title': 'INTERNATIONAL TRADE COMMISSION REVERSES ALJ FINDING THAT 3SHAPE INDIRECTLY INFRINGES ALIGN PATENTS', 'text': "SAN JOSE, CALIF., NOV. 18, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ALIGN TECHNOLOGY, INC. (NASDAQ: ALGN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE\xa0INTERNATIONAL TRADE COMMISSION\xa0(ITC) ISSUED ITS NOTICE OF FINAL DETERMINATION IN AN INVESTIGATION INITIATED BY\xa0ALIGN AGAINST 3SHAPE A/S, 3SHAPE TRIOS A/S, AND 3SHAPE, INC., MODIFYING AND REVERSING PARTS OF THE INITIAL DETERMINATION OF THE ADMINISTRATIVE LAW JUDGE\xa0(ALJ) WHICH FOUND 3SHAPE INFRINGED TWO OF ALIGN'S PATENTS AND FOUND A VIOLATION OF SECTION 337 OF THE TARIFF ACT OF 1930. THE ALJ RECOMMENDED AN EXCLUSION ORDER AND CEASE AND DESIST ORDER BE ENTERED AGAINST 3SHAPE'S UNLAWFUL IMPORTATION."}